speaker guide "Campus guide" color 0.2 0.85 1
node start
 say guide "Welcome to Tessera. Every exhibit uses the engine itself." time 3
 choice "Tell me about the water." water
 choice "What can I interact with?" play
 choice "End conversation." goodbye
node water
 set learnedWater 1
 say guide "The sea follows your camera. Boxes, cloth and ropes float, and the controller can swim." time 5
 goto start
node play
 say guide "Use E at each exhibit. Left click pushes physics objects and carves voxel specimens. M opens the directory." time 5
 goto start
node goodbye
 say guide "Enjoy the campus." time 2
 end
